{"lines":[{"h":0.017484660423827014,"x":0.08024692031965977,"y":0.042108362942825606,"w":0.23251027425130208,"t":"Sample Writing answers","c":1},{"y":0.085971372014567948,"c":1,"w":0.3607904815673828,"h":0.025778144773521472,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","x":0.079943955983654391},{"y":0.12156770501311298,"h":0.021206088565965731,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 4.5 score.","x":0.080067952784780516,"w":0.69782740275065103,"c":1},{"t":"In their advertising, businesses nowdays sometimes stress that their products are new in some","h":0.024694689873110187,"x":0.12738506060925223,"c":1,"w":0.78844950358072918,"y":0.14789971584630468},{"t":"way. From my point of view, some businesses want to have good products to give to the people, but","h":0.023830846285511131,"w":0.83160120646158853,"y":0.16977559867070846,"x":0.080098470207026554,"c":1},{"x":0.08003772824049965,"t":"usually they worry about their products are newer than some other's businesses products.","y":0.18902132056013476,"w":0.75752548217773441,"h":0.025055612355154633,"c":1},{"x":0.12534249887699464,"y":0.21705981087807202,"h":0.025450562700646828,"w":0.75352376302083335,"c":1,"t":"In think it is a negative development, because when businesses stress about the quality of"},{"c":1,"x":0.080089442733968397,"y":0.23830808357366307,"w":0.78639928181966146,"h":0.025118991820354486,"t":"their products, sometimes they do something wrong while they are producing them. It is good"},{"t":"when the businesses take care of and look after their products but with a limit. According to some","y":0.25869029559230572,"x":0.08215602741187325,"w":0.8274366251627604,"h":0.022698679857736992,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.83578109741210938,"t":"experts, when you take a lot of care of something, you will probably do some things, about it, wrong.","x":0.082096398603121942,"h":0.026526652179983179,"y":0.27867670669830069},{"h":0.027151307733937813,"x":0.12943289023995364,"y":0.30660890368650917,"c":1,"t":"From my own experience, I was trying to make three school projects, which my teachers asked","w":0.78650182088216147},{"x":0.082114909366027763,"y":0.32695949315673056,"h":0.025808049034594882,"c":1,"w":0.81724543253580739,"t":"me to do, and despite my hard work and because I was stressed about the projects I had to do, I"},{"h":0.021602758670443034,"c":1,"y":0.35093792067034335,"w":0.42835759480794272,"t":"finally failed because I had made a lot of mistakes.","x":0.082101661548835761},{"y":0.37659109614937047,"t":"To sum up, businesses nowdays should not stress about their products being new in some way.","w":0.79245208740234374,"x":0.129474291825532,"c":1,"h":0.023633507592658476},{"c":1,"t":"Besides that they should calm down and be careful on what they are producing.","w":0.6730937194824218,"h":0.022961840051082483,"x":0.08420514664889775,"y":0.39791176901179859},{"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","w":0.31275721232096354,"c":1,"y":0.43749999985956389,"x":0.086419747751763795,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"x":0.13153313343776385,"y":0.46775402668768939,"w":0.78224039713541671,"h":0.023569219384794282,"c":1,"t":"This response does not really address the requirements of the question. There is a"},{"y":0.48610676284705123,"x":0.13156083282270223,"t":"view expressed at the beginning of the second paragraph [a negative development]","c":1,"h":0.021210590717508859,"w":0.790397237141927},{"w":0.78836573282877598,"c":1,"t":"but mainly, the writer is talking about the quality of products rather than advertising.","x":0.13153451784539594,"y":0.50314473532718151,"h":0.023895809591448325},{"c":1,"t":"In the third paragraph, an example is given about an unsuccessful school project","w":0.76778854370117189,"h":0.021280926725749327,"x":0.13153873800537771,"y":0.52214174995364981},{"h":0.020542949051963633,"y":0.54053405240525709,"w":0.73894500732421875,"t":"which is not relevant to the question either. This response only touches on the","c":1,"x":0.13156288138373809},{"t":"question set, and is a tangential response. Ideas are not arranged conerently,","x":0.13363307968645216,"w":0.73270604451497379,"h":0.017194344663226779,"c":1,"y":0.56045347983457905},{"x":0.13356742654516088,"y":0.57517809334498493,"h":0.022954925069820109,"c":1,"t":"as they do not address the task given. Paragraphing is not helpful and there is a","w":0.75756368001302099},{"w":0.7801839192708333,"h":0.02229080829238439,"t":"one-sentence paragraph. Vocabulary is not appropriate as it does not focus on the","x":0.13357177086454158,"y":0.59286057863519992,"c":1},{"x":0.13374485796377106,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.12551439921061197,"y":0.6162790696009246,"t":"question set."},{"t":"Sentence structure shows a mix of simple and more complex forms with a range","x":0.13364032460160055,"y":0.64733976374071933,"w":0.76153310139973951,"h":0.018648491310146675,"c":1},{"t":"of tenses and modal and comparative structures. There are a number of errors but","y":0.66352454953010476,"x":0.1335922857827318,"w":0.78427195231119784,"c":1,"h":0.021557076659724839},{"t":"they do not reduce communication.","c":1,"x":0.13354485568268595,"h":0.019700450245707879,"w":0.33784856160481769,"y":0.68419047161847846},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"134","x":0.090534978653808107,"w":0.039094651540120429,"c":1,"y":0.9156976742625762}],"w":2400,"h":3396}